      "html": "<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"sidekik-hero\" class=\"sidekik-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto gap-8 pb-24 max-md:pb-12 section-shell--nav-clearance section-shell--nav-clearance-with-padding section-shell--fluid-mobile-padding\" style=\"--section-shell-padding-top:13rem;--section-shell-padding-top-mobile:6rem;\"><div class=\"sidekik-logo sidekik-case-logo\"><img src=\"/content-media/work/sidekik/sidekik-logo.png\" alt=\"Sidekik.io\" width=\"500\" height=\"250\" decoding=\"async\"></div><p class=\"text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">B2B SaaS · Launch, search and lifecycle marketing</p><h1 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-5xl max-md:leading-none max-md:tracking-display text-6xl\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">Sidekik</span><span class=\"block text-slatecolor\">Launch visibility. Lasting growth.</span></h1><nav class=\"sidekik-case-navigation\" aria-label=\"Case study sections\"><a href=\"#sidekik-overview\">Results overview</a><a href=\"#sidekik-approach\">Our approach</a><a href=\"#sidekik-results\">Performance detail</a><a href=\"#sidekik-lifecycle\">Lifecycle programme</a><a href=\"#sidekik-measurement\">Measurement notes</a></nav></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"sidekik-overview\" class=\"sidekik-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-6 max-md:py-4\" ><div class=\"bw-dashboard spartan-charts sidekik-charts\"><div class=\"bw-dashboard-header\"><div><h2 class=\"bw-dashboard-heading\">Sidekik · Growth overview</h2><p class=\"bw-dashboard-period\">Reporting scope is shown on each card</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"bw-dashboard-replay\" data-bw-replay hidden aria-label=\"Replay Sidekik charts\">Replay</button></div><div class=\"bw-dashboard-grid\"><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-narrow sp-green\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sk-retention-title\" data-sk-chart=\"retention\"><h3 id=\"sk-retention-title\">Customer retention</h3><div class=\"sp-ring\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 144 144\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle class=\"sp-ring-track\" cx=\"72\" cy=\"72\" r=\"56\"/><circle class=\"sp-ring-progress\" cx=\"72\" cy=\"72\" r=\"56\" transform=\"rotate(-90 72 72)\" stroke-dasharray=\"330.746874569933 21.111502632123\" data-bw-ring data-bw-ring-circumference=\"351.858377202057\" data-bw-ring-arc=\"330.746874569933\" data-sp-percent=\"94\"/></svg><p class=\"sp-ring-value\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">94%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"94\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">94</span>%</span></p></div><p class=\"bw-card-description sp-ring-description\">Reported customer retention</p><p class=\"sp-note\">Engagement-wide result. The retention cohort and interval were not specified.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-wide sp-peach\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sk-growth-title\" data-sk-chart=\"monthly-growth\"><h3 id=\"sk-growth-title\">Average monthly growth</h3><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">30 to 35 percent</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"30\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">30</span>–<span data-bw-counter=\"35\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">35</span>%</span></p><div class=\"sk-range-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sk-range-band\" style=\"--sk-range-left:75.00000000%;--sk-range-width:12.50000000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sk-low=\"30\" data-sk-high=\"35\" data-sk-maximum=\"40\"></div></div><div class=\"sp-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>0%</span><span>40% scale</span></div><p class=\"sk-range-caption\">Coloured band shows the reported range.</p><p class=\"sp-note\">Engagement-wide reported range. The underlying growth measure was not broken out further.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-wide sp-dark\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sk-views-title\" data-sk-chart=\"views-index\"><h3 id=\"sk-views-title\">Website views</h3><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">Approximately 97,000</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"97\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">97</span>k</span></p><p class=\"sp-derived\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">+677.3%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+<span data-bw-counter=\"677.3\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">677.3</span>%</span> versus previous period</p><div class=\"sp-revenue-plot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Website views relative comparison: previous period index 100, current period index 777.3. Zero baseline; 800-point scale.\"><div class=\"sp-column\"><div class=\"sp-column-track\"><div class=\"sp-column-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-height:25.00000000px\" data-bw-bar=\"vertical\" data-sk-value=\"100\" data-sk-maximum=\"800\"></div></div><p class=\"sp-plot-value\">100</p><p class=\"sp-plot-label\">Previous period</p></div><div class=\"sp-column\"><div class=\"sp-column-track\"><div class=\"sp-column-bar sp-column-bar--current\" style=\"--sp-bar-height:194.32500000px\" data-bw-bar=\"vertical\" data-sk-value=\"777.3\" data-sk-maximum=\"800\"></div></div><p class=\"sp-plot-value\">777.3</p><p class=\"sp-plot-label\">Current period</p></div></div><div class=\"sp-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Zero baseline</span><span>Index scale: 800</span></div><p class=\"sp-note\">Previous period = 100. The current index expresses the reported percentage increase.</p><p class=\"sk-period\">GA4 · 1 July–31 October 2026</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-narrow sp-blue\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sk-purchases-title\"><h3 id=\"sk-purchases-title\">Tracked purchases</h3><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">Approximately 1,200 tracked purchases</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">~<span data-bw-counter=\"1200\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">1,200</span></span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">Sitewide GA4 purchases</p><p class=\"sk-period\">1 July–31 October 2026</p><p class=\"sp-note\">Presented as the reported analytics total. Revenue and unique paying-customer counts are separate measures.</p></article></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"sidekik-brief\" class=\"sidekik-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">The brief</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">At Fyntix, we brought Sidekik’s positioning, conversion pages, paid search, search visibility and lifecycle email into one growth programme. Sidekik is a Sydney-based B2B AI receptionist serving service businesses.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">For this kind of product, growth involves several connected decisions. A prospective customer needs to understand the offer, recognise a relevant use for it and feel comfortable trying it. The customer then needs to reach a useful first outcome and develop a reason to return. Our approach connected those moments so that discovery, conversion and continued use supported the same commercial objective.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"sidekik-challenge\" class=\"sidekik-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">A launch needs a complete customer journey</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">An early-stage SaaS business has to make choices about where its budget and attention go. More visits are useful when the experience after arrival gives a prospective customer a clear next step. That means the message, the page and the product introduction need to answer different questions without making the customer assemble the story for themselves.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">We treated the customer journey as a sequence of practical decisions. What problem is this person trying to solve? Which part of the offer is relevant? What will help them begin? And once they have started, what makes the next action useful? Those questions gave the work a common direction while allowing each channel and customer communication to have a specific purpose.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"sidekik-approach\" class=\"sidekik-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">Our growth approach</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><h3 class=\"mt-6 mb-3 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">Make the first visit useful</h3><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">We developed the marketing website and landing pages around product value and the intent behind each visit.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">A useful page helps someone recognise their situation before asking for a commitment. For a service business evaluating an AI receptionist, that can mean understanding how enquiries, calls or bookings fit into everyday work. Clear language and a relevant next step make the decision easier to follow. The point is to connect a product capability with a practical outcome the customer can recognise.</p><h3 class=\"mt-6 mb-3 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">Connect the search with the message</h3><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">Our acquisition work combined Google Ads, search-focused landing pages, SEO, AEO and GEO.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">Campaign relevance begins with the relationship between a query and the page that answers it. A page can help someone compare the offer, understand a particular use case or resolve a setup question. Organising the content around those needs gives the visitor a more direct route through the decision and gives the team a clearer reason for each page to exist.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">For Google’s AI search experiences, <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/appearance/ai-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2\">foundational SEO guidance</a> still applies. Content needs to be accessible, indexed and eligible for Search to have the opportunity to appear as a supporting link. Clear, useful answers and understandable product information therefore support the same broader goal: helping a prospective customer find a reliable explanation of the offer.</p><h3 class=\"mt-6 mb-3 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">Make activation part of acquisition</h3><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">We paired acquisition with behaviour-triggered onboarding, trial, milestone, expansion, billing and re-engagement communications.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">The purpose of a lifecycle message is to make the next useful action easier to recognise. A new account, an unfinished setup and a billing issue are different situations. Treating them differently gives communication a job beyond reminding someone that the product exists. It also keeps the experience connected to what the customer has already done, rather than asking them to restart the relationship with every message.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">For us, retention belongs in the growth conversation from the beginning. Acquisition creates an opportunity; activation and continued value help the business make more of it. Reviewing those parts together gives a team a better basis for deciding whether the next priority is more demand, a clearer first-use experience or a stronger reason for an existing customer to keep using the service.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"sidekik-results\" class=\"sidekik-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-12 max-md:py-6\" ><div class=\"bw-dashboard spartan-charts sidekik-charts\"><div class=\"bw-dashboard-header\"><div><h2 class=\"bw-dashboard-heading\">Performance, in detail</h2><p class=\"bw-dashboard-period\">Website activity, email engagement and modelled discovery</p></div></div><div class=\"bw-dashboard-grid\"><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sk-half sp-green\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sk-sessions-title\" data-sk-chart=\"sessions-index\"><h3 id=\"sk-sessions-title\">Sessions</h3><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">Approximately 56,000</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"56\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">56</span>k</span></p><p class=\"sp-derived\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">+555.1%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+<span data-bw-counter=\"555.1\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">555.1</span>%</span> versus previous period</p><div class=\"sp-revenue-plot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sessions relative comparison: previous period index 100, current period index 655.1. Zero baseline; 800-point scale.\"><div class=\"sp-column\"><div class=\"sp-column-track\"><div class=\"sp-column-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-height:25.00000000px\" data-bw-bar=\"vertical\" data-sk-value=\"100\" data-sk-maximum=\"800\"></div></div><p class=\"sp-plot-value\">100</p><p class=\"sp-plot-label\">Previous period</p></div><div class=\"sp-column\"><div class=\"sp-column-track\"><div class=\"sp-column-bar sp-column-bar--current\" style=\"--sp-bar-height:163.77500000px\" data-bw-bar=\"vertical\" data-sk-value=\"655.1\" data-sk-maximum=\"800\"></div></div><p class=\"sp-plot-value\">655.1</p><p class=\"sp-plot-label\">Current period</p></div></div><div class=\"sp-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Zero baseline</span><span>Index scale: 800</span></div><p class=\"sp-note\">Previous period = 100. The current index expresses the reported percentage increase.</p><p class=\"sk-period\">GA4 · 1 July–31 October 2026</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sk-half sp-blue\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sk-users-title\" data-sk-chart=\"users-index\"><h3 id=\"sk-users-title\">Active users</h3><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">Approximately 40,000</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"40\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">40</span>k</span></p><p class=\"sp-derived\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">+535.8%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+<span data-bw-counter=\"535.8\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">535.8</span>%</span> versus previous period</p><div class=\"sp-revenue-plot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Active users relative comparison: previous period index 100, current period index 635.8. Zero baseline; 800-point scale.\"><div class=\"sp-column\"><div class=\"sp-column-track\"><div class=\"sp-column-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-height:25.00000000px\" data-bw-bar=\"vertical\" data-sk-value=\"100\" data-sk-maximum=\"800\"></div></div><p class=\"sp-plot-value\">100</p><p class=\"sp-plot-label\">Previous period</p></div><div class=\"sp-column\"><div class=\"sp-column-track\"><div class=\"sp-column-bar sp-column-bar--current\" style=\"--sp-bar-height:158.95000000px\" data-bw-bar=\"vertical\" data-sk-value=\"635.8\" data-sk-maximum=\"800\"></div></div><p class=\"sp-plot-value\">635.8</p><p class=\"sp-plot-label\">Current period</p></div></div><div class=\"sp-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Zero baseline</span><span>Index scale: 800</span></div><p class=\"sp-note\">Previous period = 100. The current index expresses the reported percentage increase.</p><p class=\"sk-period\">GA4 · 1 July–31 October 2026</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-narrow sp-peach\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sk-opens-title\" data-sk-chart=\"email-opens\"><h3 id=\"sk-opens-title\">Average email open rate</h3><div class=\"sp-ring\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 144 144\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle class=\"sp-ring-track\" cx=\"72\" cy=\"72\" r=\"56\"/><circle class=\"sp-ring-progress\" cx=\"72\" cy=\"72\" r=\"56\" transform=\"rotate(-90 72 72)\" stroke-dasharray=\"147.780518424864 204.077858777193\" data-bw-ring data-bw-ring-circumference=\"351.858377202057\" data-bw-ring-arc=\"147.780518424864\" data-sp-percent=\"42\"/></svg><p class=\"sp-ring-value\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">42%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"42\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">42</span>%</span></p></div><p class=\"bw-card-description sp-ring-description\">Reported average open rate</p><p class=\"sp-note\">Engagement-wide email reporting.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-wide sp-green\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sk-email-clicks-title\" data-sk-chart=\"email-clicks\"><h3 id=\"sk-email-clicks-title\">Average email click-through</h3><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">4 to 5 percent</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"4\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">4</span>–<span data-bw-counter=\"5\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">5</span>%</span></p><div class=\"sk-range-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sk-range-band\" style=\"--sk-range-left:40.00000000%;--sk-range-width:10.00000000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sk-low=\"4\" data-sk-high=\"5\" data-sk-maximum=\"10\"></div></div><div class=\"sp-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>0%</span><span>10% scale</span></div><p class=\"sk-range-caption\">Coloured band shows the reported range.</p><p class=\"sp-note\">Engagement-wide reported click-through range. Shown independently from the open rate.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-full sp-white\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sk-channels-title\" data-sk-chart=\"channel-mix\"><h3 id=\"sk-channels-title\">Where discovery came from</h3><p class=\"sp-kicker\">Modelled view allocation · 1 July–31 October 2026</p><div class=\"sk-channel-stack\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sk-channel-segment\" style=\"--sk-share:71.1%;--sk-channel-color:#262626\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sk-share=\"71.1\"></div><div class=\"sk-channel-segment\" style=\"--sk-share:13.4%;--sk-channel-color:#f75d3b\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sk-share=\"13.4\"></div><div class=\"sk-channel-segment\" style=\"--sk-share:10.0%;--sk-channel-color:#759ab4\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sk-share=\"10.0\"></div><div class=\"sk-channel-segment\" style=\"--sk-share:2.9%;--sk-channel-color:#7fae91\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sk-share=\"2.9\"></div><div class=\"sk-channel-segment\" style=\"--sk-share:1.7%;--sk-channel-color:#d6a06f\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sk-share=\"1.7\"></div><div class=\"sk-channel-segment\" style=\"--sk-share:0.8%;--sk-channel-color:#aaa4b6\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sk-share=\"0.8\"></div><div class=\"sk-channel-segment\" style=\"--sk-share:0.1%;--sk-channel-color:#7d6ba4\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sk-share=\"0.1\"></div></div><ul class=\"sk-channel-legend\"><li><span class=\"sk-channel-name\"><span class=\"sk-channel-swatch\" style=\"--sk-channel-color:#262626\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Direct</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">71.1%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"71.1\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">71.1</span>%</span></strong></li><li><span class=\"sk-channel-name\"><span class=\"sk-channel-swatch\" style=\"--sk-channel-color:#f75d3b\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Referral</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">13.4%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"13.4\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">13.4</span>%</span></strong></li><li><span class=\"sk-channel-name\"><span class=\"sk-channel-swatch\" style=\"--sk-channel-color:#759ab4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Paid Search</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">10.0%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"10.0\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">10.0</span>%</span></strong></li><li><span class=\"sk-channel-name\"><span class=\"sk-channel-swatch\" style=\"--sk-channel-color:#7fae91\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Organic Search</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">2.9%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"2.9\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">2.9</span>%</span></strong></li><li><span class=\"sk-channel-name\"><span class=\"sk-channel-swatch\" style=\"--sk-channel-color:#d6a06f\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Organic Shopping</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">1.7%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"1.7\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">1.7</span>%</span></strong></li><li><span class=\"sk-channel-name\"><span class=\"sk-channel-swatch\" style=\"--sk-channel-color:#aaa4b6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Unassigned</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">0.8%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"0.8\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">0.8</span>%</span></strong></li><li><span class=\"sk-channel-name\"><span class=\"sk-channel-swatch\" style=\"--sk-channel-color:#7d6ba4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Organic Social</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">0.1%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"0.1\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">0.1</span>%</span></strong></li></ul><p class=\"sp-derived\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">87.4%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"87.4\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">87.4</span>%</span> Direct + Referral + Organic Search</p><p class=\"sp-note\">Modelled from the reported 10% Paid Search share and GA4 session mix. These are modelled allocations, rather than measured channel-level view counts. Direct can include visits with an unidentified source.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-full sp-white\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sk-metrics-table-title\"><h3 id=\"sk-metrics-table-title\">The results, in one view</h3><div class=\"sp-table-wrap\"><table><caption>Reported results and their measurement scopes</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Metric</th><th scope=\"col\">Result</th><th scope=\"col\">Scope</th><th scope=\"col\">How to read it</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Customer retention</th><td>94%</td><td>Engagement-wide</td><td>Cohort and retention interval unspecified</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Monthly growth</th><td>30–35%</td><td>Engagement-wide</td><td>Reported range; growth base unspecified</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Email open rate</th><td>42%</td><td>Engagement-wide</td><td>Reported average</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Email click-through</th><td>4–5%</td><td>Engagement-wide</td><td>Reported average range</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Views</th><td>97k · +677.3%</td><td>1 Jul–31 Oct 2026</td><td>GA4, compared with previous period</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Active users</th><td>40k · +535.8%</td><td>1 Jul–31 Oct 2026</td><td>GA4, compared with previous period</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Sessions</th><td>56k · +555.1%</td><td>1 Jul–31 Oct 2026</td><td>GA4, compared with previous period</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Tracked purchases</th><td>~1,200</td><td>1 Jul–31 Oct 2026</td><td>Sitewide GA4 total</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"sp-note\">Rounded analytics totals are retained as reported. The website window is distinct from engagement-wide retention, growth and email reporting.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-full sp-white\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sk-channel-table-title\"><h3 id=\"sk-channel-table-title\">The channel model, in detail</h3><div class=\"sp-table-wrap\"><table><caption>Modelled views by channel · rounded shares and reported allocations</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Channel</th><th scope=\"col\">Modelled share</th><th scope=\"col\">Modelled views</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Direct</th><td>71.1%</td><td>68,944</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Referral</th><td>13.4%</td><td>13,042</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Paid Search</th><td>10.0%</td><td>9,700</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Organic Search</th><td>2.9%</td><td>2,815</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Organic Shopping</th><td>1.7%</td><td>1,666</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Unassigned</th><td>0.8%</td><td>747</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Organic Social</th><td>0.1%</td><td>86</td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr><th scope=\"row\">Total</th><td>100.0%</td><td>97,000</td></tr></tfoot></table></div><p class=\"sp-note\">Allocations total 97,000. Small differences between a rounded share multiplied by the total and a listed allocation reflect rounding in the displayed shares.</p></article></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"sidekik-lifecycle\" class=\"sidekik-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"sidekik-lifecycle\"><div class=\"sidekik-lifecycle__intro\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">A lifecycle built around the next useful action</h2><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">We organised the lifecycle into seven stages. Each stage links a customer situation with an appropriate next action. That structure gives the team a way to review whether a message is timely, whether it answers the immediate question and what successful progress should look like. It also makes the relationship between acquisition and continued product use easier to discuss.</p></div><ol class=\"sidekik-lifecycle__grid\"><li class=\"sidekik-lifecycle__stage\"><h3>Welcome and verification</h3><p>New account → confirm access.</p></li><li class=\"sidekik-lifecycle__stage\"><h3>Onboarding and activation</h3><p>Incomplete setup → make the first useful action easier.</p></li><li class=\"sidekik-lifecycle__stage\"><h3>Trial conversion</h3><p>Trial decision → explain the next plan choice.</p></li><li class=\"sidekik-lifecycle__stage\"><h3>Value and milestones</h3><p>Progress reached → reinforce ongoing value.</p></li><li class=\"sidekik-lifecycle__stage\"><h3>Expansion and upsell</h3><p>Growing usage → review the appropriate tier.</p></li><li class=\"sidekik-lifecycle__stage\"><h3>Billing recovery</h3><p>Payment issue → help restore payment details.</p></li><li class=\"sidekik-lifecycle__stage\"><h3>Re-engagement and win-back</h3><p>Lapsed use → offer a relevant route back.</p></li></ol></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"sidekik-reading\" class=\"sidekik-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">Read the audience measures together</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\"><a href=\"https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/12253918?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2\">GA4 active users</a> describe users who meet Analytics’ engagement criteria. That measure helps frame the size of the engaged audience, while views describe content activity. Reading the measures together gives a more useful account of discovery than relying on a single large number. They also remain different from a count of unique paying customers.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">A <a href=\"https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/9191807?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2\">session</a> is a period of interaction with a site or app. A person can return and begin another session, so sessions and users describe different aspects of the experience. That distinction is useful when discussing whether the next question concerns reach, repeat visits, first-use progress or a later commercial action.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">The indexed charts put the previous period at 100 and express the reported change on the same scale. This makes the relative movement in views, sessions and active users easier to compare even though the underlying totals differ. The labels retain the rounded current totals, while the bars show relative change rather than reconstructed earlier visitor counts.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"sidekik-measurement\" class=\"sidekik-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">What the reporting tells us</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">The website analytics have a defined four-month window. Retention, monthly growth and email performance are reported for the engagement as a whole. Keeping those scopes visible makes the results easier to interpret. It also gives a business owner a clearer starting point for the next question: which customer group, action and reporting period should be compared when assessing a change?</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">A retention percentage becomes more useful when its customer cohort and observation interval are defined. A monthly growth range also needs its underlying measure to support a revenue or customer-volume forecast. Here, we preserve the reported figures and their stated scopes. The growth band preserves the reported interval. A month-by-month series and a defined growth base would support a more detailed assessment.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">Email opens are a useful reported signal, and <a href=\"https://mailchimp.com/help/apple-privacy-faq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2\">email privacy protections</a> can influence how they are recorded. Tracking pixels may be preloaded independently of a person reading a message. Clicks and meaningful product actions therefore provide helpful companion measures when reviewing whether a communication is moving someone towards the next useful step. A useful review combines these signals with activation and continued product use.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\"><a href=\"https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/15258820?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2\">Direct traffic</a> can include visits whose origin Analytics cannot clearly identify. In this case, the channel figures are a model based on the reported Paid Search share and session mix. We label that model throughout. Its categories help organise the discussion about discovery; assigning commercial credit to a channel would require a more complete acquisition and conversion analysis.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"sidekik-next\" class=\"sidekik-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">Where we would take the next test</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">The next step would be to agree the measurement definitions for the decision the team wants to make. For acquisition, that could mean following a defined group from a relevant landing page through trial activation and a paid outcome. For lifecycle work, it could mean reviewing the progress associated with a particular customer situation and message. A consistent definition makes each test easier to compare with the next one.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">We would then use that shared view to choose the next improvement: a clearer explanation, a more relevant search entry point, a stronger activation step or better-timed customer communication. The value of a connected programme is that the team can move between those decisions with a common understanding of the customer journey and the evidence available for each part of it.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"sidekik-cta\" class=\"sidekik-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col items-start gap-6\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight text-4xl text-slatecolor\">Let’s turn your launch into lasting growth.</h2><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-charcoal px-6 py-3 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-chalk\">Book a free strategy call</a></div></section></div>"
    },
